  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s36",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s36",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed prius elaborate, ut intus vitia vestra vincatis. Fiat pax primo animae et cordis cum praecepto Dei;",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s37",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s37",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut adversus consuetudi- nem corporis atque fragilitatem duo sint victores, praeceptum Dei, et consensus tuus. Casus enim talis est, medicus, aegrotus et aegritudo.",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s38",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s38",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si iste aegrotus se cum aegritudine dederit, vincitur medicus, effi- ciuntur duo adversus unum, atque superatur medi- cus.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s39",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s39",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si ergo aegrotus cum medico se dederit, vinci- tur infirmitas.",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s40",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s40",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Medicus Christus est; aegroti nos su- mus; aegritudinis morbus, consuetudo peccati est.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s41",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s41",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Jam qui ex parte renunciavit saeculo, quamvis vivat In saeculo, attendat ubi debeat inhaerere; utrum morbo an medico.",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s42",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s42",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si medico non inhaeserit, laborat medicus. Ideo nobis Evangelium in saeculo clamat et dicit :",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s43",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s43",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Esto consentiens adversario tuo cito, dum es cum illo in via (Matth. v, 25 ). Non nos docet, ut si- mus consentientes adversario diabolo;",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s44",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s44",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sed docet, ut consentientes simus adversario, praecepto divino, quod adversatur malis nostris, et adversatur consue- tudini nostrae, adversatur iniquitatibus nostris.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s45",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s45",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si consentimus, facti sumus concordes cum praecepto Dei, et accipimus quasi jugum Dei;",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s46",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s46",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "propter quod ait Dominus : Venite ad me omnes qui laboratis et onera(??)i estis, et ego reficiam vos.",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s47",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s47",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Tollite jugum meum, quia leve est, et sarcina mea levis est (Matth. xi, 28). Ecce quid tam leve?",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s48",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s48",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Denique considera quemadmo- dum qui aliquid habent in hoc mundo timent ne ra- piatur. Quomodo timent ne quod acquisierunt per- dant?",
    "chunk_index": 47,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s49",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s49",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quibus modis torquentur, quasi sub gravissi- mo pondere sollicitudinem habendo? Vos autem non aliud laboratis, nisi ut hoc faciatis quod abbas praecipit.",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s50",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s50",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Jam sub jugo es : non cogitas ubi vivas; quia n(??)c debes cogitare.",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s51",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s51",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Est qui te regat : est qui tibi curam ferat. Omnino ad vos cogitatio cibi et vestimenti nec pertinere debet.",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s52",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s52",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quod dederit abbas, sic puta quasi Deus dederit : ipsa est enim vera hu- militas. Sed forte unus plus habet, et alter minus; et hoc tamquam a Deo factum habete.",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s53",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s53",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed unus se- det ad alteram mensam; si sic jubet abbas, si sic probaverit, sic habete quasi Deus jusserit.",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s54",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s54",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "No(??)o inde interreges, ut dicas; eras ego ibi sessurussum. Nolo ut facias con(??)uetudinem ut tibi des illam ne- cessitatem.",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s55",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s55",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si forte non est quod detur, aut non vi- detur ut detur; sic habe, aut quia non est quod de- tur, aut visum est non expedire ut detur.",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s56",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s56",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ista, tratres, si servaveritis, prorsus vitam aeternam habebitis. Nolite permittere vos verbis malis agi.",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s57",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s57",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si forte aliquis infirmus cadit, ut loquatur perversa; statim cohi- bete illum : statim dicite : Noli facere, noli, frater, peccas.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s58",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s58",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Debetis enim, propter quod in unum estis, et abbatem unum habetis, e vos vobis abbates esse.",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s59",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s59",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Numquid unus, quia duos oculos et duas aures ha- bet, abbas potest omnes audire, aut omnes videre? aut non habet necessitatem alicubi exire et aliquid providere?",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s60",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s60",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vos vobis abbates estote; et quomodo metuistis abbatem praesentem, metuite et abse(??)em, quia praesens est Deus.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s61",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s61",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Omnino hoc timete, hoc me- tuite, quia Deus semper praesens est. Et si unus cu- ram fert tantis : quanto magis vos omnes ferre de- betis;",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s62",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s62",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ne inveniat unde irascatur, unde doleat, unde offendatur, unde ingemiscat, unde putet quia peribit labor ejus tanti temporis?",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s63",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s63",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Haec enim tunc nobis pote- runt prodesse, si habuerimus humilitatem, obedien- tiam et charitatem.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s64",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s64",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vi(??) alia ad Deum non est, nisi humilitas, obedientia et charitas. Ipse est via, veritas, et vita.",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s65",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s65",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam cruciari, jejunare biduo, triduo, quatri- duo, septimanas facere frequenter, inde superbiunt fra- tres, putantes quia quod ipsi faciunt, alius facere non potest :",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s66",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s66",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "infinitum putant esse quod alius non potest facere : aut ambulat nudo pede, et arbitratur quoniam ipse solus hoc potest facere :",
    "chunk_index": 65,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s67",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s67",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "aut forte nec bibit nec ipsam aquam mixtam; exercitatio temporalis est, quia semper illud facere non potest.",
    "chunk_index": 66,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s68",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s68",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed cogitet magis humilitatem, cogitet pietatem, charitatem, obedien- tiam.",
    "chunk_index": 67,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s69",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s69",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Propter enim frangendas vires corporis, propter domandum sangulnem et carnem debet arripere ista quasi bonus athleta;",
    "chunk_index": 68,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann#PL18.ANN.s70",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/novatus-catholicus/pl18_5_ann",
    "canonical_ref": "PL18.ANN.s70",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sed non inde glo- rietur, ne perdat quod fecit Nam Pharisaeus ille qui ascendit in templum orare, numquid opera, quae numerabat, modica erant?",
    "chunk_index": 69,
